summary:
  Today's radiology news highlights advancements in cancer treatment, AI's increasing role in imaging interpretations, and evolving healthcare models. Several articles discuss the impact of lifestyle factors on long-term health and brain aging, alongside discussions about the future of radiology practice.

top_stories[8]{title,source,url,category,importance,ai_summary}:
  Title: Radiology practice prepares to ditch hospital partner 3 years before new contract ends
  Source: Radiology Business
  URL: https://news.google.?oc=5
  Category: news
  Importance: 95
  ai_summary: "A major radiology practice is ending its partnership with a hospital three years before their current contract expires, signaling potential shifts in the healthcare landscape and financial pressures on radiology services."
  
